      <scope classrefs="object" doc="file(name[, mode[, buffering]]) -&gt; file object&#xA;&#xA;Open a file.  The mode can be &apos;r&apos;, &apos;w&apos; or &apos;a&apos; for reading (default)," ilk="class" name="FileType">
